      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="hero-kicker"><span class="status-dot"></span>RESEARCH, IN THE OPEN</span><h2 id="hero-title">Good questions.<br><em>Public knowledge.</em></h2><p>Fund the questions that matter. Follow the evidence.<br class="desktop-only"/> Help make the next chapter of finance an open book.</p><button class="button lime" @click="scrollTo('missions')">Find your next mission<UiIcon name="arrow" :size="18"/></button><span class="hero-caption">Independent minds. Shared understanding.</span></div><ResearchIllustration/><span class="hero-corner">CIVIQUILL FIELD NOTES <span>VOL. 01</span></span></section>
