          <div v-else-if="filtered.length" class="mission-list" aria-label="Research missions"><article v-for="m in filtered" :key="m.key || m.id" class="mission-row"><div class="mission-symbol" :class="topicColors[m.category]"><UiIcon :name="topicIcons[m.category]" :size="28"/></div><div class="mission-info"><div class="mission-meta"><span>{{ m.category }}</span><span class="meta-divider">/</span><span>{{ m.sample ? 'SAMPLE BRIEF' : m.status }}</span></div><h3><button @click="openDetails(m)">{{ m.title }}</button></h3><p>{{ m.description }}</p><div class="mission-foot"><span><UiIcon :name="m.sample ? 'book' : 'clock'" :size="13"/>{{ m.sample ? m.difficulty : m.deadline }}</span><span>{{ m.sample ? 'Open for exploration' : `${m.submissions} contributions` }}</span></div></div><div class="mission-reward"><button class="icon-button bookmark-button" :class="{ saved: isSaved(m) }" :aria-pressed="isSaved(m)" :aria-label="`${isSaved(m) ? 'Unsave' : 'Save'} ${m.title}`" @click="saveMission(m)"><UiIcon name="bookmark" :size="18"/></button><strong>{{ m.reward }} <small>ETH</small></strong><span>{{ m.sample ? 'Example reward' : 'Total funded' }}</span><button class="read-brief" @click="openDetails(m)">Read brief<UiIcon name="arrow" :size="15"/></button></div></article></div>
          <div v-else class="empty-state"><UiIcon :name="activeView === 'Saved' ? 'bookmark' : 'search'" :size="32"/><h3>{{ anyFilters ? 'A fresh question might help.' : activeView === 'Saved' ? 'Keep a question for later.' : activeView === 'My activity' ? 'Your research starts here.' : 'The next question could be yours.' }}</h3><p>{{ anyFilters ? 'No briefs match these filters. Try another topic or clear your search.' : activeView === 'Saved' ? 'Bookmark a mission and find it here, saved on this device.' : activeView === 'My activity' ? account ? 'Missions you create with this wallet will appear here.' : 'Connect your wallet to find the missions you have created.' : 'There are no published missions yet. Create a brief to get things started.' }}</p><button v-if="activeView === 'My activity' && !account && !anyFilters" class="button primary" @click="connectWallet" :disabled="connecting">{{ connecting ? 'Connecting…' : 'Connect wallet' }}</button><button v-else class="button secondary" @click="resetFilters(); activeView = 'All missions'">Explore all missions<UiIcon name="arrow" :size="16"/></button></div>
          <div class="board-bottom"><span aria-live="polite">{{ filtered.length }} {{ filtered.length === 1 ? 'question' : 'questions' }}. A world of possibilities.</span><button v-if="configured" @click="refreshMissions" :disabled="loading"><UiIcon name="refresh" :size="14"/>Refresh</button><button v-else @click="resetFilters(); activeView = 'All missions'">View all topics<UiIcon name="arrow" :size="14"/></button></div>
        </section>
        <aside class="right-rail" aria-label="Research resources"><section class="field-note"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="note-line"></span>THE CIVIQUILL WAY</div><div class="note-art" aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="quill" :size="50"/><span class="note-orbit"></span><span class="note-plus">+</span></div><h2>Knowledge grows<br>when it’s shared.</h2><p>A good source. An unexpected finding. A clearer explanation. There’s more than one way to move a question forward.</p><button @click="openGuide">Make your first contribution<UiIcon name="arrow" :size="16"/></button><div class="note-number">A NOTE FROM THE COMMONS <span>01</span></div></section><section class="quick-start"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST CHAPTER</div><h3>From curious to contributor.</h3><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Find your question</strong><p>Pick a brief that sparks something.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Follow the evidence</strong><p>Read, research, and cite your sources.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Share what you learn</strong><p>Submit your work for creator review.</p></div></li></ol><button class="text-button" @click="openGuide">Read the field guide<UiIcon name="external" :size="14"/></button></section><div class="independent-note"><UiIcon name="globe" :size="19"/><p>Built for Robinhood Chain.<br><strong>Independent by design.</strong></p></div></aside>
      </div>
